    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "From the rate equation, it can be deduced that only CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>CH<sub>3</sub> and OH<sup>- </sup>are involved in the **rate-determining step** and not bromine (Br<sub>2</sub>)",
