    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>CH<sub>3</sub> and OH<sup>-</sup> are only involved in the first step of the reaction mechanism, therefore the **rate-determining step **is:",
